Z||000014||FieroFanaticus2||12-18-2001||06:33 AM||||Well, the alternator for this one is anywhere between $135 - $195 at autozone and is a special order.  I'd like to go for it, but I think I should finish some of my other projects first.  Plus I took a look on ebay and saw some 924's going REAL cheap.  I'm already in debt anyway.||||reg||1
